#: ../../../developer/services/qrexec2.rst:103 4d56bb82ff0b486a992d8cd07e30f256
msgid ""
"Be very careful when coding and adding a new RPC service! Any vulnerability "
"in a RPC server can be fatal to security of the target VM!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/qrexec2.rst:105 381cab6d7767481a9ca014b7da0f3405
